<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [1302].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1302&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SEA SALTS YTG MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Yeast extract </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Tryptone </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Glucose </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Sea salts (Sigma-Aldrich) </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;30.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace minerals (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=151">151</a>) </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 0.1% Na<sub>2</sub>SeO<sub>3</sub> solution </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml   </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> L-Cysteine&#183;HCl&#183;H<sub>2</sub>O </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Resazurin </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L   </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components and adjust pH to 7.0.  Dispense the medium into culture vessels under a N<sub>2</sub> gas atmosphere (e.g., 10 ml medium in Hungate tubes), seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave.  After cooling, aseptically and anaerobicallly add per liter the following solutions (filter-sterilized): <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace vitamins (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=197">197</a>) </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 1M Sodium thiosulfate solution </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml        </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
